        <item>
            <title>0.1.13</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in 0.1.13</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Added subscription quota support for CLIProxyAPI and Wei-Shaw/sub2api, including provider settings and secure credential storage.</li>
                    <li>Added a two-row menu-bar quota icon option and refined quota marker alignment and settings controls.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
